  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated support for refugees from Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Romania is preparing the transition from emergency solutions offered to refugees fleeing the war in Ukraine, to longer-term solutions to be offered especially to the most vulnerable willing to settle in the country. Groupe SOS and Ateliere Fara Frontiere, along with public and private partners, are launching a pilot program to provide a 360 solution to 50 vulnerable households (100 beneficiaries), for 6 months, from medium-term accommodation to full social support (legal, social, psychological).</narrative>
  </description>
